---
// Disclaimer.astro - Directiva de Aclaratoria y Protocolo del Sistema
---

<section
  aria-label="Directiva de Aclaratoria y Términos"
  class="mt-16 sm:mt-20 mb-8 sm:mb-10 w-full"
>
  <!-- MARCO PRINCIPAL: DOCUMENTO CLASIFICADO / DIRECTIVA TÁCTICA -->
  <div
    class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 border-red-900/40 dark:border-red-900/60 bg-[#0e0f12] text-neutral-200 p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden"
  >
    <!-- Luces de advertencia ambiental (Glow sutil) -->
    <div
      class="absolute -top-28 -left-28 w-60 h-60 bg-red-900/20 blur-[110px] pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute -bottom-28 -right-28 w-60 h-60 bg-red-950/25 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"
    >
    </div>

    <!-- Scanline táctica sobreimpresa -->
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-[linear-gradient(rgba(18,19,22,0)_50%,rgba(0,0,0,0.35)_50%)] bg-[length:100%_4px] opacity-25"
    >
    </div>

    <div class="relative z-10">
      <!-- CABECERA DE LA DIRECTIVA: MARCADORES MILITARES -->
      <div
        class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-red-900/40 pb-5 mb-8 font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-[11px]"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-600 animate-pulse"></span>
          <span
            class="text-red-500 font-bold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase"
          >
            DIRECTIVA DE SEGURIDAD // AVISO DEL SISTEMA
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span
            class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-600/40 bg-red-950/60 text-red-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[9px]"
          >
            PRIORIDAD: OBLIGATORIA
          </span>
          <span class="text-neutral-400 tracking-wider hidden sm:inline">
            SEC_ID: 00-DISC
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TÍTULO PRINCIPAL DEL DOCUMENTO -->
      <div class="mb-10">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter uppercase italic flex items-center gap-3"
        >
          Nota de <span class="text-red-600 drop-shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(220,38,38,0.4)]">Aclaratoria</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">
          // PROTOCOLO DE DIVULGACIÓN, ESTÉTICA Y SALVAGUARDA DE PRIVACIDAD
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- MATRIZ DE CLÁUSULAS / ARTÍCULOS TÁCTICOS -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10">
        <!-- CLÁUSULA 01 -->
        <article
          class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/90 bg-neutral-900/60 p-5 sm:p-6 backdrop-blur-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-red-900/50 transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-red-500/90 mb-3 border-b border-neutral-800/80 pb-2">
              <span class="font-bold">// PARÁMETRO 01</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-400 font-medium">NATURALEZA</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 tracking-tight">
              Lógica No Comercial
            </h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Este espacio opera bajo una lógica puramente <strong class="text-white font-bold underline decoration-red-800">creativa y expresiva</strong>. No existe beneficio económico ni fines comerciales; es una extensión de la subjetividad personal en el tejido digital.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-neutral-800/50 font-mono text-[9px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
            ESTATUTO: NO MONETIZADO
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CLÁUSULA 02 -->
        <article
          class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/90 bg-neutral-900/60 p-5 sm:p-6 backdrop-blur-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-red-900/50 transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-red-500/90 mb-3 border-b border-neutral-800/80 pb-2">
              <span class="font-bold">// PARÁMETRO 02</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-400 font-medium">SIMULACIÓN</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 tracking-tight">
              Ficción Atmosférica
            </h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Las estéticas se inspiran en la <strong class="text-white font-bold underline decoration-red-800">atmósfera opresiva de Silent Hill</strong> y la melancolía del <strong class="text-white font-bold">Lo-fi</strong>. Son fragmentos de un mundo imaginario, no reflejos literales de la realidad.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-neutral-800/50 font-mono text-[9px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
            INSPIRACIÓN: PSIQUIS // HORROR
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CLÁUSULA 03 -->
        <article
          class="relative rounded-xl border border-neutral-800/90 bg-neutral-900/60 p-5 sm:p-6 backdrop-blur-xs flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-red-900/50 transition-colors duration-300"
        >
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-[10px] text-red-500/90 mb-3 border-b border-neutral-800/80 pb-2">
              <span class="font-bold">// PARÁMETRO 03</span>
              <span class="text-neutral-400 font-medium">SALVAGUARDA</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 tracking-tight">
              Privacidad y Anonimato
            </h3>
            <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              <strong class="text-white font-bold underline decoration-red-800">No se revelarán nombres</strong>, rostros identificables ni eventos privados. Este proyecto respeta el anonimato de terceros, utilizando únicamente elementos abstractos para la composición.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-neutral-800/50 font-mono text-[9px] text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
            PROTECCIÓN: RIGUROSA
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- PIE DEL PROTOCOLO: VERIFICACIÓN Y REGISTRO -->
      <div
        class="pt-6 border-t border-neutral-800/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center gap-4 font-mono text-[11px]"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-neutral-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
            REGISTRO:
          </span>
          <span class="text-red-500 font-bold tracking-wider animate-pulse">
            SNXWY_PROY_JA
          </span>
          <span class="text-neutral-600 hidden md:inline">|</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-400 text-[10px] hidden md:inline">
            CRC: 0x94FA28
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-400 bg-neutral-900/80 border border-neutral-800 px-2.5 py-1 uppercase tracking-wider">
            ESTADO:
          </span>
          <span
            class="text-[10px] text-yellow-500 bg-neutral-900/90 px-2.5 py-1 font-bold animate-pulse border border-yellow-500/30 tracking-widest uppercase"
          >
            ACTIVO // VIGENTE
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
